WEBVTT

00:01.960 --> 00:08.500
<i>Causes of death are many and varied. 
Old age, suicide, illness...</i>

00:08.500 --> 00:13.230
<i>But the cause of death that scares the 
most people in this day and age...</i>

00:16.760 --> 00:18.050
<i>...is death by fire.</i>

00:21.410 --> 00:26.830
<b>FIZZLE</b>

00:27.080 --> 00:30.040
This is great!
Arthur found his way back to us!

00:30.380 --> 00:33.170
Tamaki, you did great holding up as 
vanguard so long on your own!

00:33.170 --> 00:35.670
I thought I was gonna 
puke from the pressure.

00:57.120 --> 00:59.030
Captain!

01:02.250 --> 01:04.320
Stay there and watch.

01:05.000 --> 01:09.580
<i>This can't be happening.
They put an Insect in the captain?</i>

01:14.850 --> 01:16.210
<i>It can't be real.</i>

01:18.300 --> 01:20.630
This can't be real!

01:21.640 --> 01:23.520
RIP

01:21.640 --> 01:23.520
RIP

01:21.640 --> 01:23.520
RIP

01:21.640 --> 01:23.520
RIP

01:21.640 --> 01:23.520
RIP

01:21.640 --> 01:23.520
RIP

01:26.820 --> 01:28.600
His muscles are so tough,

01:28.600 --> 01:30.550
the Insect can't penetrate?!

01:28.850 --> 01:30.810
<b>CLANK</b>

01:31.060 --> 01:34.180
Putting me in that cell was a mistake!

01:34.180 --> 01:36.570
My muscles are in optimum condition!

01:37.440 --> 01:40.010
Look! The captain!

01:40.010 --> 01:42.370
What's he doing there?

01:43.870 --> 01:45.120
<b><i>SNAP</i></b>

01:50.970 --> 01:52.970
<i>Most muscular.</i>

01:54.210 --> 01:56.560
This appears to be an emergency situation.

01:56.560 --> 01:59.120
Everyone, provide support for Captain Obi!

02:01.100 --> 02:03.630
Captain Obi, looking sharp!

02:04.100 --> 02:06.590
Come on. Cheer him on as we always do.

02:06.590 --> 02:09.660
Looking good! Nice work cutting!
Optimum condition!

02:09.660 --> 02:11.300
Your muscles are so thick!

02:11.300 --> 02:13.940
You're huge! Those blood vessels 
are standing out nicely!

02:14.940 --> 02:16.150
<b>RIPPED</b>

02:18.110 --> 02:20.900
You got one of our Matchboxes 
on your shoulders or something?

02:22.030 --> 02:24.190
Your pecs have got swagger!

02:25.440 --> 02:28.000
You must've been sleepless with worry,
and you still managed that?

02:28.000 --> 02:29.620
Your abs are like a chocolate bar!

02:31.230 --> 02:32.590
Oil king!

02:33.880 --> 02:37.340
Oh, no! The captain's serious this time!

02:38.130 --> 02:40.710
Sister, let's cheer the captain on, too!

02:41.180 --> 02:43.410
Captain, you're a new breed of human!

02:43.410 --> 02:45.960
Please grant blessings upon his muscles!

02:45.960 --> 02:46.810
Látom!

02:46.810 --> 02:47.650
Shoulders big as melons!

02:50.230 --> 02:51.390
This man is unbelievable!

02:52.480 --> 02:53.110
<b>LEAP</b>

02:52.480 --> 02:53.110
<b>LEAP</b>

02:52.480 --> 02:53.110
<b>LEAP</b>

02:53.310 --> 02:54.820
<b>PLINK</b>

02:54.060 --> 02:54.820
<b>PLINK</b>

02:54.320 --> 02:54.820
<b>PLINK</b>

02:56.940 --> 02:58.070
<b>BOOM</b>

03:00.150 --> 03:00.950
<b>BOOM</b>

03:03.070 --> 03:05.640
The hysterical strength 
of the fire site, is it?

03:05.640 --> 03:08.530
But the moment his muscles relax, it's over.

03:09.490 --> 03:11.330
You haven't much time.

03:11.760 --> 03:13.770
Captain Burns.

03:14.320 --> 03:17.090
I'm gonna send you flying!

03:17.090 --> 03:18.400
Nice! Really buff!

03:17.540 --> 03:20.140
You're workin' with different stuff!

03:19.590 --> 03:20.440
You're huge!

03:20.440 --> 03:21.280
So ripped!

03:21.280 --> 03:22.460
Ripped! And lookin' good!

03:22.460 --> 03:23.960
You're so ripped!

04:37.080 --> 04:40.960
<b>Fire Force</b>

04:37.380 --> 04:40.960
<b>Chapter 3</b>

04:53.980 --> 04:56.980
<b>Episode 5
"Chance Meeting with an Arch-Enemy"</b>

05:00.590 --> 05:02.960
It appears he's managing to hold on.

05:02.960 --> 05:05.120
We have to hurry up and get over there, too.

05:08.260 --> 05:11.370
It seems you're the last one left.

05:11.370 --> 05:13.380
One should not indulge self-conceit.

05:13.770 --> 05:17.380
Pathetic. Truly pathetic.

05:21.380 --> 05:22.090
<b>BOOM</b>

05:22.090 --> 05:23.300
<b>RATTLE</b>

05:22.090 --> 05:23.300
<b>RATTLE</b>

05:35.670 --> 05:38.880
Before me lies nothing 
that can hold me at bay.

05:38.880 --> 05:41.970
Behind me lies only ash and ruin.

05:42.650 --> 05:45.020
L-Lieutenant, please pull back.

05:45.400 --> 05:48.790
Somehow, this guy seems completely different 
from everyone who's come before him.

05:54.020 --> 05:56.340
I am Dragon.

05:56.080 --> 05:59.210
<b>Destroyer</b>

05:57.080 --> 05:59.210
<b>Dragon</b>

05:59.430 --> 06:03.300
If you would run, then run. 
I will simply exhale.

06:03.300 --> 06:05.870
What? Dragon?

06:10.990 --> 06:13.890
So this is where you've been, dragon?

06:14.200 --> 06:17.390
You wish to be turned to dust, do you, whelp?

06:22.820 --> 06:24.900
Arthur's Excalibur is...

06:27.210 --> 06:31.530
I, the Knight King,
have never stood before a dragon.

06:31.530 --> 06:34.410
Has the force of my presence frightened you?

06:38.080 --> 06:42.100
There are only a few knights 
who may stand before a dragon.

06:42.100 --> 06:43.950
The rest of you, stand back!

06:44.530 --> 06:46.870
If you insist.

07:00.690 --> 07:02.230
The video feed has been cut off!

07:02.230 --> 07:04.310
What was that attack?

07:12.100 --> 07:13.390
Impressive.

07:17.020 --> 07:19.590
<i>This dragonic pressure...</i>

07:19.590 --> 07:21.740
<i>This is no average dragon.</i>

07:21.750 --> 07:26.210
<b>Dragon</b>

07:22.320 --> 07:23.730
<i>This guy is...</i>

07:26.750 --> 07:32.050
Excalibur, defeat him,
and I shall bestow a title upon you!

07:33.600 --> 07:36.360
The title of Dragonslayer!

07:36.760 --> 07:38.260
Ow!

07:41.050 --> 07:43.820
What did he do?

07:57.980 --> 08:00.010
Violet Flash!

07:58.410 --> 08:00.040
<b>Violet</b>

07:58.410 --> 08:00.040
<b>Violet</b>

07:58.870 --> 08:00.040
<b>Flash</b>

07:58.870 --> 08:00.040
<b>Flash</b>

08:06.740 --> 08:08.320
Dragon destroyed!

08:06.750 --> 08:08.670
<b>Dragon Destroyed</b>

08:19.320 --> 08:22.480
Imagine there being someone 
of his caliber in the 8th.

08:23.310 --> 08:24.370
However...

08:32.610 --> 08:35.840
Unfortunately, that won't work on Dragon.

08:49.090 --> 08:52.080
Hmm, that was quite lovely.

08:56.290 --> 08:59.060
You're very capable for a human.

08:59.060 --> 09:03.570
A human? You speak as if you 
aren't a human yourself.

09:03.570 --> 09:05.820
I am Dragon.

09:08.550 --> 09:10.250
What a coincidence.

09:10.250 --> 09:12.060
I am a knight!

09:12.440 --> 09:19.070
<b>SHAKE SHAKE</b>

09:14.360 --> 09:19.670
I'm shaking with a warrior's excitement.
A... A knight's excitement.

09:23.080 --> 09:27.450
My Excalibur's first strike is a deadly one!
There will not be a second.

09:27.450 --> 09:31.830
That's what I'd like to say, but when 
it's a dragon I'm facing, I can't!

09:32.160 --> 09:36.990
Dragon! I shall continue to wield 
Excalibur until you are defeated!

09:36.990 --> 09:40.170
I, the Knight King, am determined 
to face you with everything I have!

09:49.180 --> 09:52.220
<i>What? With his dragonic pressure alone?</i>

09:52.220 --> 09:56.400
<i>Now this is true dragonic pressure!</i>

09:58.770 --> 10:01.740
You do not simply retreat.
You also attack as you do so.

10:05.760 --> 10:08.010
You aim precisely

10:08.760 --> 10:12.570
for the heart of a human,
or the core of an Infernal.

10:12.570 --> 10:14.950
And your skills are good for your age.

10:15.340 --> 10:17.510
But I am Dragon!

10:17.720 --> 10:18.840
<b></b>Dragon

10:22.450 --> 10:25.730
I see. Your strength grows even greater.

10:25.730 --> 10:27.110
Dragon!

10:31.580 --> 10:34.860
The person he's fighting is 
so big and seems so strong.

10:34.860 --> 10:37.290
Will Arthur-san be all right?

10:37.290 --> 10:41.640
Soldier Arthur's ignition power 
depends on the image he creates.

10:41.640 --> 10:43.690
Having found a powerful, ideal opponent,

10:43.690 --> 10:46.390
he's working with the strongest 
image he's ever had.

10:46.390 --> 10:49.830
I don't think anyone could stop 
Soldier Arthur right now.

10:54.360 --> 10:56.810
The strength of your flame 
and the way you wield it...

10:56.810 --> 10:59.010
You've achieved true mastery.

11:00.140 --> 11:04.210
My sword's... My sword... blade...

11:05.760 --> 11:08.890
He's the best opponent Arthur could ask for.

11:08.890 --> 11:11.360
It's just bad luck for the old guy he's fighting.

11:14.280 --> 11:18.950
Lieutenant, why don't you use that gun to 
back up Arthur instead of staring at it?

11:18.950 --> 11:21.240
I've already fired several shots.

11:21.560 --> 11:25.300
And they should've been more than backup.
I fired several lethal shots.

11:30.750 --> 11:33.960
But none of them did any damage.

11:33.960 --> 11:36.000
I suspect Arthur's attacks are the same.

11:36.580 --> 11:39.610
And isn't it strange?

11:39.610 --> 11:42.490
Arthur is attacking,
and Dragon isn't doing anything,

11:46.570 --> 11:49.150
but Arthur's the one who's hurt!

11:51.020 --> 11:54.020
<b>Fire Force</b>

11:51.020 --> 11:54.020
<b>Chapter 3</b>

11:54.020 --> 11:57.020
<b>Fire Force</b>

11:54.020 --> 11:57.020
<b>Chapter 3</b>

12:00.530 --> 12:03.520
It seems you are weak after all, human.

12:03.520 --> 12:07.530
And Dragon, you are an impressive dragon.

12:07.800 --> 12:11.550
A dragon of your caliber 
is no ordinary dragon!

12:13.460 --> 12:15.330
I will defeat you...

12:16.090 --> 12:18.910
and I will become a dragon slayer!

12:21.350 --> 12:23.920
All he did was get close 
enough to attack again!

12:23.920 --> 12:27.290
Weak indeed. You're wounded by my scales?

12:33.390 --> 12:35.900
<b><i>Dragon Scale</i></b>

12:33.570 --> 12:35.550
Dragon Scale!

12:35.890 --> 12:38.640
What? The place where he's been cut...

12:40.020 --> 12:43.150
The fearsome Dragon Scale.

12:45.200 --> 12:48.880
We're too far away for me to see clearly,
but those scales...

12:48.880 --> 12:51.400
They're like an Infernal's body!

12:56.160 --> 12:59.160
You did well for a human.

13:09.270 --> 13:11.840
Arthur, are you okay? Hang in there!

13:12.140 --> 13:13.860
What's with that arm?

13:13.860 --> 13:17.860
It's dark and hardened,
just like an Infernal's would be!

13:18.200 --> 13:21.240
Your ignition powers are strengthened 
by the images in your mind.

13:21.240 --> 13:23.030
That was a good approach.

13:23.450 --> 13:26.060
But you haven't grasped the Adolla yet.

13:26.360 --> 13:28.790
What?

13:30.010 --> 13:34.010
If you only use the power of one side,
that's as far as you'll go.

13:42.630 --> 13:46.510
He's able to transform his body 
into that of an Infernal at will!

13:46.510 --> 13:48.990
It can't be! That's impossible!

13:51.200 --> 13:52.580
Huo Yan!

13:52.580 --> 13:55.040
You've been here of all places?

13:55.040 --> 13:56.980
What is it, Karim?

13:56.980 --> 13:59.140
Rekka's work records.

13:59.530 --> 14:01.350
I've been looking through Rekka's past

14:01.350 --> 14:03.320
and the records of his away 
missions while he served,

14:02.920 --> 14:03.020
<b>Special Fire Force Company 1</b>

14:02.920 --> 14:03.020
<b>Investigation Reports</b>

14:03.020 --> 14:03.150
<b>Special Fire Force Company 1</b>

14:03.020 --> 14:03.150
<b>Investigation Reports</b>

14:03.150 --> 14:05.650
<b>Special Fire Force Company 1</b>

14:03.150 --> 14:05.650
<b>Investigation Reports</b>

14:03.320 --> 14:05.660
and I found something weird.

14:05.660 --> 14:08.660
What did you find? What's wrong?

14:08.990 --> 14:12.450
Rekka frequently visited an orphanage.

14:12.450 --> 14:15.760
The place where the 5th's Captain Hibana 
and the 8th's Sister came from,

14:15.760 --> 14:19.290
and where they were suspected 
of researching doppelgangers.

14:20.040 --> 14:21.030
That means...

14:21.540 --> 14:26.790
Yeah. Rekka was somehow 
connected to doppelgangers.

14:29.340 --> 14:31.670
Doppelgangers.

14:31.670 --> 14:34.600
Konro said that it's like 
a mirror image of you,

14:34.600 --> 14:37.070
a Demon Infernal, comes from Adolla.

14:40.730 --> 14:44.480
Are the Demon Infernals trying to kill 
the real people and become them?

14:48.630 --> 14:53.480
Is there some kind of close connection 
between doppelgangers and human combustion?

14:53.480 --> 14:56.200
If I can identify what 
doppelgangers really are,

14:56.200 --> 14:59.200
maybe I'll also be able to solve the mystery 
of spontaneous human combustion!

15:14.900 --> 15:19.010
This man who calls himself Dragon is even 
more of a special case than we thought!

15:19.010 --> 15:21.900
You mean he isn't an ordinary human?

15:22.300 --> 15:26.200
But if that's true, Arthur will be 
able to go deeper into his imagination

15:26.200 --> 15:27.780
and grow stronger.

15:27.780 --> 15:29.120
We're counting on you, Arthur!

15:29.120 --> 15:32.280
Don't worry! I've never seen 
Arthur this serious before!

15:38.010 --> 15:40.030
Stay back, Vulcan.

15:40.030 --> 15:42.520
I will. Be careful!

15:43.280 --> 15:47.510
You can do this! He's the dragon 
you've been searching for!

15:50.300 --> 15:55.840
He's finally using 
Extreme Dragonic Pressure!

15:56.070 --> 15:59.500
The outer Dragon becomes 
possessed by his inner dragon.

15:59.500 --> 16:01.250
Dragon Suit!

16:04.220 --> 16:06.880
This is the first time I've seen it.

16:06.880 --> 16:11.960
This guy must have accumulated a 
huge amount of Dragonic Experience.

16:11.960 --> 16:13.760
Die nobly, human.

16:14.980 --> 16:17.740
Defend your Knight King, Plasmantle!

16:27.960 --> 16:31.510
Was that really him just exhaling?
How's Arthur?

16:37.030 --> 16:40.260
Is that... a cape made of plasma?

16:43.290 --> 16:45.770
Dragon-Slaying Holy Sword!

16:48.020 --> 16:49.970
His output has increased even more.

16:49.970 --> 16:50.990
He's incredible!

16:51.270 --> 16:55.690
If not for this sword and cape I found in 
the caldera, that would have ended badly.

16:55.690 --> 16:58.310
What's this about a caldera, whelp?

16:58.310 --> 17:01.770
The heat of a volcano's mouth 
amounts to very little!

17:05.390 --> 17:08.220
Get him, Arthur! You're the Knight King!

17:08.220 --> 17:09.630
You can do it, Knight King!

17:11.920 --> 17:14.860
A holy blow that shall slay the dragon!

17:15.290 --> 17:18.460
Excalibur!

17:32.110 --> 17:34.480
Excalibur is...

17:43.790 --> 17:47.540
You didn't quite manage to slay the dragon.

17:48.580 --> 17:51.040
Arthur! Hang in there!

17:51.360 --> 17:54.930
Before me lies nothing 
that can hold me at bay.

17:56.190 --> 17:59.010
People equal dust!

17:59.430 --> 18:01.850
<b>People = Dust</b>

18:06.270 --> 18:06.850
<b>BAM</b>

18:06.270 --> 18:06.850
<b>BAM</b>

18:06.850 --> 18:08.520
BOOM

18:08.980 --> 18:13.520
Even given the captain's muscles,
there's no telling how long he'll last.

18:13.860 --> 18:15.860
There isn't much time.

18:21.310 --> 18:22.640
Four of a kind.

18:21.970 --> 18:23.010
<b>Four of a Kind</b>

18:22.640 --> 18:25.910
You'll never escape these four cards!

18:27.540 --> 18:29.420
I have no need to even dodge them!

18:35.620 --> 18:37.880
He didn't seem like he was 
even thinking about dodging.

18:38.390 --> 18:41.120
I will take all of your attacks.

18:41.460 --> 18:44.100
That is my duty!

18:44.710 --> 18:48.910
You're so bound by duty, it's exhausting.

18:49.760 --> 18:53.830
You left your organization, 
and you've lived in darkness.

18:53.830 --> 18:57.580
Has your freedom changed this empire?

18:58.010 --> 19:02.740
The ones to change the empire won't be dark 
heroes like me who live in the shadows.

19:04.910 --> 19:06.520
It'll be real heroes.

19:08.250 --> 19:11.250
Come! I shall take whatever attack you make!

19:25.240 --> 19:28.480
The weak obey the strong.

19:28.890 --> 19:31.520
If you would break that system...

19:32.140 --> 19:35.350
then show me you can overcome it, young one!

19:35.520 --> 19:38.490
<b>Voltage Nova</b>

19:35.520 --> 19:38.490
<b>Voltage Nova</b>

19:38.490 --> 19:41.990
<b>To Be Continued</b>

21:11.950 --> 21:13.460
<b>Fire Force Chapter 3</b>

21:13.150 --> 21:16.410
My prayers lack for nothing.
 In which case...

21:13.460 --> 21:14.750
<b>Next Time</b>

21:16.410 --> 21:18.010
I made a promise.

21:18.010 --> 21:21.960
And for the sake of that promise,
I'll send this world and that god flying!

21:21.960 --> 21:23.900
Next time, "Beyond Prayer's End."

21:21.960 --> 21:26.960
<b>Episode 6</b>

21:21.960 --> 21:26.960
<b>Beyond Prayer's End</b>

21:23.900 --> 21:26.600
Return to the great flame of fire. Látom.
